00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:58.290
So remember, I said we can't use
the future to predict the past.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.407
Scikit-learn knows how
to handle that even

00:14:00.407 --> 00:14:02.240
in the case where you're
doing a whole bunch

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.200
of cross-validation thing.

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:08.150
And so that's what we're doing
here to fit in SVR our model.

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:11.670
I can go ahead and run
this Python code chunk

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:14.820
