00:15:04.622 --> 00:15:06.080
The other thing
that will point out

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.480
is if we look at
the environment pane

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:11.060
when we switch to
the Python context,

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:14.820
we actually got a Python
environment Explorer as well.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:17.930
And so these objects that I'm
