00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.930
What if I then wanted to go
and do some further analysis?

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:04.670
Well, you saw how I can reduce
R objects in the Python context,

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:07.520
but I can do the same
thing inside of R.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:11.480
So inside of R there's this
