00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.240
is going on inside of our data.

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:47.990
All right.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:51.770
So we've fit this model that
combines R and Python together

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.180
