00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:54.930
What do we do now?

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.440
Well, at RStudio,
we're big believers

00:16:57.440 --> 00:17:01.300
that you should share your data
science work early and often.

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:03.770
This is the best way for
people with domain knowledge

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:08.280
or stakeholders to validate
that you're on the right path.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:11.599
And so one way to do that
